approximate amounts and composition of materials per square yard for 
the sealcoat shall be as provided in Table 2.  The exact amounts to be 
used shall be determined by the Contracting Officer.\par
}\pard \sl0\tx288\tx864\tx1440\tx2016\tx2592\tx3168\tx3744\tx4320\tx4896\tx5472\tx6048\tx6624\tx7200\tx7776\tx8352\tx8928\tx9504\tx10080\tx10656 
